<PageLayout
  title="Teaching - Luca Wetherall"
  description="Singing Teacher and Musicologist. I offer singing lessons (classical, musical theatre, jazz, and pop) and Oxbridge interview practice."
>
  <article>
    <h1 class="page-title">Teaching</h1>
    <div class="content body spectral-override">
      <p>I am an experienced singing teacher and vocal technician teaching students of all ages and specialising in classical, pop, jazz, and musical theatre. I currently hold teaching positions at Latymer Upper and Newton Prep School. I have also taught at Leighton Park School and for Hillingdon Council. In higher education I work with undergraduate music students and choral scholars at the University of Oxford as well as on the BA Musical Theatre course at the Liverpool Institute for Performing Arts (LIPA). I previously held teaching positions with the Girls’ Choir of Merton College Oxford and the Choir of Liverpool Cathedral.</p>

      <p>I also offer A-Level Music tuition as well as mock interviews and preparation sessions for Oxford and Cambridge university entrance to their undergraduate Music course. I am interested in hearing from prospective applicants who want to talk about any aspect of the process. I studied for my undergraduate degree in Music at the University of Oxford (Exeter College) where I was supervised by the Chair of Faculty. I was then a postgraduate Musicologist at Royal Holloway (fully funded by The Headley Trust) and am now a fully funded doctoral researcher (DPhil Music), Tutor in Music, and Clarendon Scholar at the University of Oxford.</p>

      <p>If you are interested in having an online lesson please book a slot here:</p>

      <p><a href="https://cal.com/lucawetherall" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://cal.com/lucawetherall</a></p>

      <p>Alternatively, if you would like to have an informal conversation over email please get in touch via the contact page on this website.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>

